    now restart the plugin-loading daemons (pvedaemon, pvestatd,
    pve-ha-crm, pve-ha-lrm) immediately and defer the pveproxy restart
    by ~10 s through a transient systemd timer, so a web-UI xterm.js
    upgrade terminal survives the apt transaction. The TRUENAS_PLUGIN_NO
    _RESTART=1 escape hatch prints the manual command instead. install.sh
    mirrors the deferral: the timer is armed at installer exit (not
    mid-menu), a pending timer from the postinst is detected and not
    re-scheduled, stale failed unit state is 'reset-failed' before
